# BRUTAL DIAGNOSIS — POST-FIX RE-EVALUATION
## kicc-platform · 2026-09-06

## Summary: What Changed

| Fix Round | Files Changed | Issues Fixed |
|-----------|---------------|--------------|
| Round 1 (previous) | ~20 | casts(), fillable, N+1 fixes, cache middleware, eager loading, zoom config, permission indexes |
| Round 2 (this session) | ~60 | AnalyticsService 144x bug, MessagingController orWhere data leak, duplicate model classes deleted, ShardManager SQLi, CloudflareStreamService creds/URLs, 16 guarded→fillable, 20+ pagination fixes, 49 cache middleware routes, AuctionController 500, 13 casts() additions, auth+throttle on mutation routes, DataAvailabilityService algorithm, model event cache busting |

## Remaining Issues by Severity

