# 🔴 CRITICAL (11)

| # | File:Line | Issue |
|---|-----------|-------|
| 1 | `CountyController.php:315,317` | **Undefined variable typo**: `$entityIdCache` used but `$entityIdsCache` is defined — sector page items always empty |
| 2 | `CountyController.php:551-552` | **Undefined variable**: `$sectorHeroAsset` never defined, overwrites correct `$sectorHeroPoster` — hero poster broken |
| 3 | `AuthController.php:228` | **Undefined variable**: `$ipKey` never defined — `RateLimiter::clear()` does nothing |
| 4 | `CmsController.php:174` | **Misspelled validation key**: `'ategory'` instead of `'category'` — category field cannot be updated |
| 5 | `ThumbnailService.php:155-162` | **curl_getinfo before curl_exec**: `exists()` always returns false |
| 6 | `VideoService.php:55` | **Integer treated as county name**: `Str::title($screen->county_id)` — shows "1 County" instead of real name |
| 7 | `CountyServices/CountyService.php` | **Table name conflict**: Uses `$table = 'sector_entities'` — same table as `SectorEntity`, data corruption risk |
| 8 | `UssdService.php:181` | **orWhere without grouping**: Can match wrong user across phone number formats |
| 9 | `N8nService.php:47,49,62,82` | **Direct `env()` calls** bypassing config cache (also 6 Pipeline engines + ShardManager) |
| 10 | `ShoppingCart.php:12` | **`$appends = ['item_count']`** — always loads `items` relation, guaranteed N+1 on every cart serialization |
| 11 | `Product.php:59-75` | **Accessor N+1**: `getPriceAttribute()` + `getImageUrlAttribute()` load ALL variants + ALL images every access |

