# ✅ RESOLVED (since first diagnosis)

| Issue | Status |
|-------|--------|
| `$guarded = []` on 16 models | ✅ All → `$fillable` |
| Duplicate class definitions (CmsModels, KiccWebsiteModels) | ✅ Deleted, merged into standalone files |
| AnalyticsService 144x revenue bug | ✅ `monthly*12*12` → `sum(min(price)) * 12` |
| MessagingController orWhere data leak | ✅ Both `inbox()` + `unreadCount()` grouped |
| ShardManager SQL injection | ✅ Parameter binding + whitelist |
| CloudflareStreamService credentials + broken URLs | ✅ Config-driven + subdomain fix |
| 20+ unbounded controller queries | ✅ Paginated |
| 49 public GET routes missing cache | ✅ CachePublicResponse + withoutMiddleware |
| AuctionController 500 (scopeActive) | ✅ `scopeActive()` → `active()` |
| 13 models missing casts | ✅ Added |
| Auth+throttle on review/safety/AI/n8n routes | ✅ |
| 6-hour cache TTL (stale admin data, deleted school) | ✅ Admin=60s, Public=600s, model event busting |
| Orphan SectorEntity (deleted parent still showing) | ✅ DataAvailabilityService filters at query level |

